**Role:** Co-organizer & Curator  
**Event:** [TEDxKish](https://www.ted.com/tedx/events/68405) · November 5, 2026 · farhang sara niavaran, tehran, Tehrān, Iran

## Overview

TEDxKish is an independently organized TEDx event that brings the community together to share ideas worth spreading. I served as co-organizer and as a curator for three of the talks, working with the speakers to shape each idea into a talk that fit the theme and the audience.

Because of the war situation, the organizing team worked from Tehran. That meant rethinking how we reached the people of Kish. We promoted the event through Kish's local media, ran charity work on the island, and offered discounts to Kish locals so the event stayed open to the community it was named after.

